          "recommendation": "两半壳体连接为可选卡扣、螺钉或铰接方式。",
          "evidence": [
            {
              "source_path": "h1-study/team_package_20260928/sources/WO2024250011A1.html",
              "source_sha256": "1842bd29f950f82b162f3f1b3d3d5733ac4223a5bf41a798d0be41e516495284",
              "locator": "说明书[0009] (HTML p0009)",
              "quote": "[0006] According to an aspect of the present disclosure, a device for filtering microfibers from the laundry water during a normal washing cycle is disclosed, the device comprising a hard, protective outer shell and a removable, porous inner filter. The porous inner filter can include an electrospun PLA or cellulose mesh. The porous inner filter can include a PLA or cellulose foam. [0007] The rigid, outer shell can be made up of two hemispherical halves with varying permeability. The halves can be connected via flexural and snap fit or via a screw or hinge mechanism.",
